## Step 1: Clone and Build (5 minutes)

### Get the Code
```bash
git clone https://github.com/KJ-Sagar/FreeRTOS_Master.git
cd FreeRTOS_Master
git checkout Phase-3  # Or main branch
cd FreeRTOS-Plus/Demo/SOME_IP_Demo
```

### Install Dependencies
```bash
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install -y \
    gcc-arm-none-eabi \
    qemu-system-arm \
    python3 \
    ufw
```

### Compile
```bash
make clean
make
```

