## Step 4: Understand the Flow (10 minutes)

### Network Topology
```
Your Machine (10.0.0.1)
    ↓ TCP Port 30509
QEMU/FreeRTOS (10.0.0.2)
    ↓ Processes SOME/IP
Services: Heartbeat, Sensor, Engine
```

### Message Flow

#### 1. Service Discovery (Optional)
```python
# Client queries available services (UDP)
FindService → [Server]
[Server] → OfferService (0x1234, 0x1001, 0x1002)
```

#### 2. Subscribe to Event
```python
# Client subscribes to heartbeat notifications
SUBSCRIBE(EventGroup=0x0001, TTL=15) → [Server]
[Server] → ACK
```

#### 3. Receive Notifications
```python
# Server sends notifications every 2 seconds
[Server] → NOTIFICATION(Heartbeat=1)
[Server] → NOTIFICATION(Heartbeat=2)
[Server] → NOTIFICATION(Heartbeat=3)
```

#### 4. Send Request
```python
# Client can still send requests (same connection)
REQUEST(Method=Heartbeat) → [Server]
[Server] → RESPONSE(alive=1)
```

#### 5. Unsubscribe
```python
# Client stops notifications
UNSUBSCRIBE(EventGroup=0x0001) → [Server]
[Server] → ACK
[No more notifications]
```

